Inside one root request (agentkeepalive@4.1.4) the fresh debug@^4.1.0 leads to the locked ms@^2.1.3 (registry.npmjs.org) while the fresh humanize-ms@^1.2.1 leads to the fresh ms@^2.0.0: which is resolved first depends on which packument arrives first. Default registry, no delay (see open-order-race-*-slow for both outcomes).
